OL,3,GNEWSAPair caught with thousands had
OL,4,Alaundered #17m
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been jailed after an
OL,7,Finvestigation found they laundered more
OL,8,Fthan #17m in cash.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Police said Kexie Liu,
OL,11,F31, and Jiarun Li, 26, attempted to
OL,12,Fboard a flight to Beijing while on
OL,13,Fbail.
OL,15,FThe Birmingham residents, from
OL,16,FBromsgrove Street, were arrested in
OL,17,FSeptember last year on suspicion of
OL,18,Fmoney laundering, after #49,000 in cash
OL,19,Fwas recovered from a vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
