OL,3,GNEWSAPair caught with thousands had
OL,4,Alaundered #17m
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiu, who pleaded guilty to possessing
OL,7,Fand transferring criminal property, was
OL,8,Fjailed for four years and nine months
OL,9,Fat Birmingham Crown Court. Li admitted
OL,10,Fpossession of criminal property and was
OL,11,Fgiven 18 months.
